# AB-033: An indicator changes reversibly while its amount stays constant
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 bromothymol_blue 0.0000001mol
add v1 HCl 0.0001mol
measure v1 ph
measure v1 eyes
add v1 NaOH 0.0002mol
measure v1 ph
measure v1 eyes
add v1 HCl 0.0002mol
measure v1 ph
measure v1 eyes
inspect
